<title>INDIA: Indian Aug foodgrains stocks 22.06 mln tonnes.</title>
<headline>Indian Aug foodgrains stocks 22.06 mln tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian foodgrains stocks fell to 22.06 million tonnes in August from 25.27 million tonnes in July, and against 32.01 million tonnes in August last year, the government said on Monday.</p>
<p>    FOODGRAINS STOCKS    Aug 96	July 96	Aug 95</p>
<p>    Rice		     10.46	 11.89	  13.93</p>
<p>    Wheat		    11.60	 13.38	  18.08</p>
<p>    Total		    22.06	 25.27	  32.01</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are in millions of tonnes and preliminary. Stocks of coarse grains are included in the totals but not broken out separately.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
